OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged with murder over
OL,4,Awoman's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged with murder
OL,7,Ffollowing the death of a woman in
OL,8,FBradford.
OL,10,FPolice were called to Carr Bottom Road,
OL,11,Fin Little Horton, at about 01:40 GMT on
OL,12,FTuesday following reports of a serious
OL,13,Fassault on two women.
OL,15,FTahira Hussain, 46, was pronounced dead
OL,16,Fat the scene, while a 20-year-old woman
OL,17,Fwas taken to hospital with serious
OL,18,Finjuries.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
