OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged with murder over
OL,4,Awoman's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FWest Yorkshire Police said Bilal Ajmal,
OL,7,F26, of Carr Bottom Road was due to
OL,8,Fappear before city magistrates charged
OL,9,Fwith murder and attempted murder.
